    <div data-elastic-include style="position: absolute; translate: -100vw 0;">
        <h2>OVERVIEW</h2>
        <p>UNITROL® 1000 is ABB’s compact and reliable automatic voltage regulator (AVR) series designed to keep synchronous generators and motors stable, efficient and protected. It delivers fast and accurate voltage control for machines from 100 kVA to 80 MVA, ensuring consistent performance even during rapid load changes or in harsh environments.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>With more than 45,000 installations worldwide, UNITROL 1000 is trusted across power plants, marine vessels, rail systems and critical backup power applications. It integrates easily with automation and electrical systems and works seamlessly with ABB digital tools for monitoring and optimization.</p>

    </div>
