<div id="cmp-8c288f82f4">
    <div data-elastic-include style="position: absolute; translate: -100vw 0;">
        <h2>KEY BENEFITS OF UNITROL 1000</h2>
        <p>&lt;p&gt;Reliable voltage control made simple, scalable and easy to integrate.&lt;/p&gt;
</p>
        
            <h3>Stable and accurate voltage regulation</h3>
            </p>
            &lt;p&gt;Maintains generator and motor voltage with fast response to load changes for consistent, high-quality power.&lt;/p&gt;

            </p>
        
            <h3>Easy to commission and operate</h3>
            </p>
            &lt;p&gt;The CMT 1000 software provides easy setup, auto-tuning, and built-in recording tools that simplify commissioning and reduce human error.&lt;/p&gt;

            </p>
        
            <h3>Grid-code compliant by design</h3>
            </p>
            &lt;p&gt;Supports global grid requirements by design and includes PSS tuning assistant capabilities and certified user-defined simulation models.&lt;/p&gt;

            </p>
        
            <h3>Designed for reliability in tough environments</h3>
            </p>
            &lt;p&gt;Robust mechanical design, comprehensive protection features and ABB quality ensure safe, dependable operation.&lt;/p&gt;

            </p>
        
            <h3>Fits a wide range of generator sizes and applications</h3>
            </p>
            &lt;p&gt;Covers synchronous machine applications from 100 kVA to 80 MVA across three AVR models sharing the same platform.&lt;/p&gt;

            </p>
        
            <h3>Pre-engineered systems</h3>
            </p>
            &lt;p&gt;UNITROL® Compact and FLEXplus systems minimize system engineering and project delivery times.&lt;/p&gt;

            </p>
        
    </div>
